<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家庭夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1" RUBY="ゆりこ">Yuriko</STYLE>, calm down. It's true that <STYLE ID="2">Kotaro-kun</STYLE> is in a position that easily draws suspicion. 
{PAUSE ""}
That's exactly why we need to be a little more―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What are you saying!? Don't you think it's suspicious that the <STYLE ID="3">Grand Witch-sama</STYLE> won't even call the police!?
{PAUSE ""}
　It means the Niimura family is covering for whoever killed <STYLE ID="4">Sakura-chan</STYLE>, doesn't it!?"<PG>
"But there was no proof that <STYLE ID="2">Kotaro-kun</STYLE> did it! <STYLE ID="2">Kotaro-kun</STYLE> knows full well that he's under suspicion!"<PG>
"Then I'll go to the police tomorrow. We'll have outsiders take a proper look."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You mean to bring outsiders in!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Do you want to live in the same settlement as a murderer!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yuriko, please, just calm down..."<PG>
"I'm going to the police tomorrow, by myself."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I'll take responsibility for this myself. You don't have to do a thing."
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
